# React/Vite build output (A3.1/A3.2 migration) - regenerated by
# `npm run build`, never hand-edited. The entry .html files (404.html,
# login.html, ...) stay committed as *source* (referencing
# src/react/entries/*.jsx directly) - only the hashed bundles this
# folder holds are build artifacts.
/frontend/assets/react/

